IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `isl-nouns`

-- Income Support Law 5741-1980 (Israel), Chapter 5, Sub-chapters A and B (סימן א׳ תביעות, סימן ב׳ תשלום גימלאות) -- ss 13, 14, 14A, 14B, 15, 16, 17, 18.
-- Layer 1: the law, objectively.
--
-- Reading a result.  A yes/no question is a MAYBE BOOLEAN: JUST TRUE, JUST FALSE (only where the text says no in its own words) or NOTHING ("not covered").
-- Where a function answers "the benefit is not paid for the month", JUST TRUE is the text's own flat no (it is a ban), and NOTHING means the ban does not reach the case.
-- Calendar facts the text counts (months, days outside Israel, times the person left) are inputs the claimant states.
-- What the regulations, the Minister and the Institute's staff decide is outside the sources and is an input.

§ `Section 13 -- examining a claim (בירור תביעות)`

-- s 13(a): a claim for a benefit is submitted to the National Insurance Institute.  (Who at the Institute decides is machinery: coverage row inert 2.)
-- src:261 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} תביעה לגימלה תוגש למוסד לביטוח לאומי; עובד המוסד לביטוח לאומי שמינהלת המוסד הסמיכה אותו לכך יברר את התביעה ויחליט אם תשולם הגימלה ובאיזה שיעור תשולם.
@ref s 13(a) (src:261)
GIVETH A STRING
`s 13(a) where a claim for a benefit is submitted` MEANS "the National Insurance Institute -- המוסד לביטוח לאומי"

§ `Section 14 -- the period of payment (תקופת התשלום)`

-- s 14(a): the benefit is paid only for the period that begins on the 1st of the month in which the claim was submitted to the Institute.
-- src:267 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} גימלה תשולם רק בעד התקופה שתחילתה ב־1 לחודש שבו הוגשה למוסד לביטוח לאומי התביעה לגימלה, ואולם השר רשאי לקבוע בתקנות נסיבות שבהן תשולם הגימלה ממועד מוקדם יותר ולתקופה שקבע.
@ref s 14(a) first day (src:267)
GIVEN `the day the claim was submitted` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`s 14(a) the first day for which the benefit is paid` MEANS
    Date 1 (DATE_MONTH `the day the claim was submitted`) (DATE_YEAR `the day the claim was submitted`)

-- s 14(a): a day before that first day is outside the period -- unless a regulation the Minister made sets circumstances in which the benefit is paid from an earlier day.
-- src:267 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} גימלה תשולם רק בעד התקופה שתחילתה ב־1 לחודש שבו הוגשה למוסד לביטוח לאומי התביעה לגימלה, ואולם השר רשאי לקבוע בתקנות נסיבות שבהן תשולם הגימלה ממועד מוקדם יותר ולתקופה שקבע.
@ref s 14(a) (src:267)
GIVEN `the day the claim was submitted` IS A DATE
      `the day asked about` IS A DATE
      `a regulation under s 14(a) lets the benefit be paid to this claimant from an earlier day` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 14(a) the day is within the period for which the benefit is paid` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the day asked about` AT LEAST (`s 14(a) the first day for which the benefit is paid` `the day the claim was submitted`) THEN JUST TRUE
        IF `a regulation under s 14(a) lets the benefit be paid to this claimant from an earlier day` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): the circumstances and the period are set by regulations that are not among the sources
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "גימלה תשולם רק בעד התקופה שתחילתה ב־1 לחודש שבו הוגשה"

-- s 14(c)(1): one who has reached retirement age and is found, on examining the claim, to be entitled under s 2(a)(4) also for a period before the month of
-- the claim is paid for that period too -- but for no more than the 12 months immediately before the month of the claim, and not for a period in which
-- they had not yet reached retirement age.  "Months before" counts the month immediately before the month of the claim as 1.
-- src:269 | {{ח:תת|(ג)|(1)}} על אף האמור בסעיף קטן (א), מי שהגיע לגיל פרישה ומבירור התביעה לפי הוראות {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 13|סעיף 13}} נקבע כי הוא זכאי לגמלה לפי הוראות {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 2|סעיף 2(א)(4)}} גם בעד תקופה שקדמה לחודש שבו הוגשה תביעתו, תשולם לו הגמלה גם בעד אותה תקופה, אך לא יותר מאשר בעד תקופה של 12 חודשים שקדמו בתכוף לחודש שבו הוגשה התביעה ולא בעד תקופה שבה טרם הגיע לגיל פרישה.
@ref s 14(c)(1) (src:269)
GIVEN `the person has reached retirement age and is found entitled under s 2(a)(4) also for a period before the month of the claim` IS A BOOLEAN
      `how many months before the month of the claim the month is` IS A NUMBER
      `the person had reached retirement age in that month` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 14(c)(1) the benefit is paid for a month before the month of the claim` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `the person has reached retirement age and is found entitled under s 2(a)(4) also for a period before the month of the claim`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the paragraph speaks only of one who has reached retirement age and is found entitled under s 2(a)(4) for an earlier period
        IF `how many months before the month of the claim the month is` LESS THAN 1 THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the paragraph is about months before the month of the claim
        IF `how many months before the month of the claim the month is` GREATER THAN 12 THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "אך לא יותר מאשר בעד תקופה של 12 חודשים שקדמו בתכוף"
        IF (NOT `the person had reached retirement age in that month`) THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "ולא בעד תקופה שבה טרם הגיע לגיל פרישה"
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

-- s 14(c)(2) "public body" (גוף ציבורי): the Government, the Jewish Agency for Eretz Israel, and a budgeted body or supported body as defined in s 32 of the
-- Budget Principles Law.
-- src:270 | {{ח:תתת|(2)}} אין בהוראות פסקה (1) כדי לזכות את מי שמשתלמת לו גמלה כאמור באותה פסקה בהטבות הניתנות לפי כל דין או בהטבות הניתנות על ידי גוף ציבורי לפי הסכם או נוהג למי שמשתלמת לו גמלה בעד תקופה שקדמה לחודש שבו הוגשה התביעה לגמלה; לעניין זה, ”גוף ציבורי“ – הממשלה, הסוכנות היהודית לארץ ישראל וכן גוף מתוקצב או גוף נתמך כהגדרתם {{ח:חיצוני|חוק יסודות התקציב#סעיף 32|בסעיף 32 לחוק יסודות התקציב, התשמ״ה–1985}}.
@ref s 14(c)(2) "public body" (src:270)
GIVEN `the Government` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Jewish Agency for Eretz Israel` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a budgeted body or a supported body as defined in s 32 of the Budget Principles Law` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 14(c)(2) "public body" the body is one` MEANS
    IF `the Government` OR `the Jewish Agency for Eretz Israel` OR `a budgeted body or a supported body as defined in s 32 of the Budget Principles Law`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "גוף ציבורי – הממשלה, הסוכנות … וכן גוף מתוקצב או גוף נתמך" is a closed list

-- s 14(c)(2): paragraph (1) does not entitle one paid under it to the privileges that any law, or a public body under an agreement or custom, gives to
-- those paid a benefit for a period before the month of the claim.
-- src:270 | {{ח:תתת|(2)}} אין בהוראות פסקה (1) כדי לזכות את מי שמשתלמת לו גמלה כאמור באותה פסקה בהטבות הניתנות לפי כל דין או בהטבות הניתנות על ידי גוף ציבורי לפי הסכם או נוהג למי שמשתלמת לו גמלה בעד תקופה שקדמה לחודש שבו הוגשה התביעה לגמלה; לעניין זה, ”גוף ציבורי“ – הממשלה, הסוכנות היהודית לארץ ישראל וכן גוף מתוקצב או גוף נתמך כהגדרתם {{ח:חיצוני|חוק יסודות התקציב#סעיף 32|בסעיף 32 לחוק יסודות התקציב, התשמ״ה–1985}}.
@ref s 14(c)(2) (src:270)
GIVEN `the person is paid the benefit under s 14(c)(1) for a period before the month of the claim` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the privilege is one that a law, or a public body under an agreement or custom, gives to one paid a benefit for a period before the month of the claim` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 14(c)(2) the person paid under paragraph (1) is entitled to the privilege` MEANS
    IF `the person is paid the benefit under s 14(c)(1) for a period before the month of the claim`
       AND `the privilege is one that a law, or a public body under an agreement or custom, gives to one paid a benefit for a period before the month of the claim`
    THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "אין בהוראות פסקה (1) כדי לזכות … בהטבות"
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the paragraph speaks only of those privileges for one paid under paragraph (1)

§ `Section 14A -- an entitled person who has left Israel (זכאי לגמלה שיצא את ישראל)`

-- s 14A(a): no benefit is paid for a calendar month to an entitled person who left Israel, if they stayed outside Israel on every day of that month.
-- "Entitled person" for subsections (a) to (c) leaves out one who, or whose spouse, has reached retirement age (subsection (c1) governs them).
-- src:273 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} לא תשולם לזכאי שיצא את ישראל גמלה בעד חודש קלנדרי אם שהה מחוץ לישראל בכל הימים שבאותו חודש. לענין סעיף קטן זה וסעיפים קטנים (ב) ו־(ג), ”זכאי“ – למעט זכאי שהוא או בן זוגו הגיעו לגיל פרישה.
@ref s 14A(a) (src:273)
GIVEN `the entitled person or their spouse has reached retirement age` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the entitled person left Israel` IS A BOOLEAN
      `they stayed outside Israel on every day of the month` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 14A(a) the benefit is not paid for the month` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the entitled person or their spouse has reached retirement age` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "זכאי" in subsections (a) to (c) leaves out one who, or whose spouse, has reached retirement age
        IF `the entitled person left Israel` AND `they stayed outside Israel on every day of the month` THEN JUST TRUE   -- the text says no in its own words: "לא תשולם … גמלה בעד חודש קלנדרי"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): a month in which they were in Israel on any day is not covered by subsection (a)

-- s 14A(b): no benefit is paid for the calendar month of exit and the calendar month of return if, before leaving, they had left Israel another time in the same
-- calendar year, or were not entitled for the calendar month before the month of exit.
-- src:274 | {{ח:תת|(ב)}} לא תשולם לזכאי שיצא את ישראל גמלה בעד החודש הקלנדרי שבו יצא (להלן – חודש היציאה) ובעד החודש הקלנדרי שבו חזר לישראל (להלן – חודש השיבה) אם הוא אחד מאלה:
-- src:275 | {{ח:תתת|(1)}} לפני שיצא את ישראל כאמור, הוא יצא את ישראל פעם נוספת באותה שנה קלנדרית;
-- src:276 | {{ח:תתת|(2)}} הוא לא היה זכאי לגמלה בעד החודש הקלנדרי שקדם לחודש היציאה.
@ref s 14A(b) (src:274-276)
GIVEN `the entitled person or their spouse has reached retirement age` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the month is the month of exit or the month of return` IS A BOOLEAN
      `before leaving they had left Israel another time in the same calendar year` IS A BOOLEAN
      `they were entitled for the calendar month before the month of exit` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 14A(b) the benefit is not paid for the month of exit and the month of return` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the entitled person or their spouse has reached retirement age` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "זכאי" in subsections (a) to (c) leaves out one who, or whose spouse, has reached retirement age
        IF (NOT `the month is the month of exit or the month of return`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the subsection speaks of the month of exit and the month of return
        IF `before leaving they had left Israel another time in the same calendar year` OR (NOT `they were entitled for the calendar month before the month of exit`) THEN JUST TRUE   -- the text says no in its own words: "לא תשולם … גמלה"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): neither condition holds, and the subsection says nothing of that case

-- s 14A(c): notwithstanding (b), no benefit is paid, for the month of exit and the month of return, to an entitled person to whom s 2(a)(2) applies, nor to one to
-- whom s 2(a)(3) applies who is in training -- unless, in addition to (b), the s 2(a)(2) or (3) condition holds throughout that month.
-- "In addition to (b)" is read as: the exception needs both that (b) does not bar payment and that the condition holds throughout the month (fork `c-exception-needs-both`).
-- src:277 | {{ח:תת|(ג)}} על אף הוראות סעיף קטן (ב), לא תשולם גמלה לזכאי שחל לגביו האמור {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 2|בסעיף 2(א)(2)}}, וכן למי שחל לגביו האמור {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 2|בסעיף 2(א)(3)}} שמצוי בהכשרה, בעד חודש היציאה ובעד חודש השיבה, אלא אם כן מתקיים לגביו, נוסף על הוראות סעיף קטן (ב), האמור {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 2|בסעיף 2(א)(2) או (3)}}, לפי הענין, בכל אותו חודש.
@ref s 14A(c) (src:277)
GIVEN `the entitled person or their spouse has reached retirement age` IS A BOOLEAN
      `s 2(a)(2) applies to the person, or s 2(a)(3) applies and the person is in training` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the month is the month of exit or the month of return` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the s 2(a)(2) or (3) condition holds throughout the whole month` IS A BOOLEAN
      `subsection (b) bars payment for the month` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 14A(c) the benefit is not paid for the month of exit and the month of return` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the entitled person or their spouse has reached retirement age` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "זכאי" in subsections (a) to (c) leaves out one who, or whose spouse, has reached retirement age
        IF (NOT `s 2(a)(2) applies to the person, or s 2(a)(3) applies and the person is in training`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the subsection names two classes
        IF (NOT `the month is the month of exit or the month of return`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the subsection speaks of the month of exit and the month of return
        IF `the s 2(a)(2) or (3) condition holds throughout the whole month` AND (NOT `subsection (b) bars payment for the month`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the exception "אלא אם כן" is met, so the subsection bars nothing
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE   -- the text says no in its own words: "לא תשולם גמלה … בעד חודש היציאה ובעד חודש השיבה"

-- s 14A(c1): for an entitled person who, or whose spouse, has reached retirement age, no benefit is paid for these months (the two of them counted together):
--   (1) they left Israel four times in a calendar year: each month in which, wholly or partly, they were outside the fourth time;
--   (1A) more than four times: each month of that year in which they were outside, wholly or partly;
--   (2) fewer than four times, but more than 72 days outside in the year: (a) each month, wholly or partly, from the 73rd to the 100th day outside;
--       (b) if more than 100 days outside, each month of the year in which they were outside, wholly or partly.
-- A month "from the 73rd to the 100th day" is read as a month that contains at least one of those days (fork `c1-month-holds-day-73-to-100`).
-- src:278 | {{ח:תת|(ג1)}} לא תשולם גמלה לזכאי שהוא או בן זוגו הגיעו לגיל פרישה, אם מתקיים האמור בפסקאות (1) או (2) שלהלן – בעד התקופות המפורטות בהן:
-- src:279 | {{ח:תתת|(1)}} הזכאי ובן זוגו יצאו את ישראל, במצטבר, ארבע פעמים באותה שנה קלנדרית – בעד כל חודש שבו, במלואו או בחלקו, שהו מחוץ לישראל בפעם הרביעית;
-- src:280 | {{ח:תתת|(1א)}} הזכאי ובן זוגו יצאו את ישראל, במצטבר, יותר מארבע פעמים באותה שנה קלנדרית – בעד כל אחד מהחודשים, באותה שנה קלנדרית שבהם שהו, בכל החודש או בחלקו, מחוץ לישראל;
-- src:281 | {{ח:תתת|(2)}} הזכאי ובן זוגו יצאו את ישראל, במצטבר, פחות מארבע פעמים באותה שנה קלנדרית, ואולם סך הימים שבהם שהו מחוץ לישראל באותה שנה קלנדרית עלה על 72 ימים –
-- src:282 | {{ח:תתתת|(א)}} בעד כל אחד מהחודשים, כולם או חלקם, מהיום ה־73 ועד ליום ה־100 שבו שהו מחוץ לישראל באותה שנה קלנדרית;
-- src:283 | {{ח:תתתת|(ב)}} בעד כל אחד מהחודשים באותה שנה קלנדרית שבהם שהו, בכל החודש או בחלקו, מחוץ לישראל, אם שהו מחוץ לישראל יותר מ־100 ימים באותה שנה קלנדרית.
@ref s 14A(c1) (src:278-283)
GIVEN `the entitled person or their spouse has reached retirement age` IS A BOOLEAN
      `how many times the entitled person and the spouse together left Israel in the calendar year` IS A NUMBER
      `the total days the two of them stayed outside Israel in the calendar year` IS A NUMBER
      `the days they stayed outside Israel before this month in the calendar year` IS A NUMBER
      `the days they stayed outside Israel in this month` IS A NUMBER
      `this month is one in which they were outside Israel, wholly or partly, for the fourth time` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 14A(c1) the benefit is not paid for the month` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `the entitled person or their spouse has reached retirement age`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): subsection (c1) is for one who, or whose spouse, has reached retirement age
        IF `how many times the entitled person and the spouse together left Israel in the calendar year` EQUALS 4 AND `this month is one in which they were outside Israel, wholly or partly, for the fourth time` THEN JUST TRUE   -- the text says no in its own words: "לא תשולם גמלה … בעד כל חודש"
        IF `how many times the entitled person and the spouse together left Israel in the calendar year` GREATER THAN 4 AND `the days they stayed outside Israel in this month` AT LEAST 1 THEN JUST TRUE
        IF `how many times the entitled person and the spouse together left Israel in the calendar year` LESS THAN 4
           AND `the total days the two of them stayed outside Israel in the calendar year` GREATER THAN 72
           AND `the days they stayed outside Israel in this month` AT LEAST 1
           AND `the days they stayed outside Israel before this month in the calendar year` AT MOST 99
           AND (`the days they stayed outside Israel before this month in the calendar year` PLUS `the days they stayed outside Israel in this month`) AT LEAST 73
        THEN JUST TRUE
        IF `how many times the entitled person and the spouse together left Israel in the calendar year` LESS THAN 4
           AND `the total days the two of them stayed outside Israel in the calendar year` GREATER THAN 100
           AND `the days they stayed outside Israel in this month` AT LEAST 1
        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): none of the paragraphs of subsection (c1) reaches this month

-- s 14A(d)(3) "medical treatment outside Israel" (טיפול רפואי מחוץ לישראל): a health service given under s 11 of the State Health Insurance Law.
-- src:288 | {{ח:תתת|(3)}} בסעיף קטן זה, ”טיפול רפואי מחוץ לישראל“ – שירות בריאות הניתן לפי הוראות {{ח:חיצוני|חוק ביטוח בריאות ממלכתי#סעיף 11|סעיף 11 לחוק ביטוח בריאות ממלכתי, התשנ״ד–1994}}.
@ref s 14A(d)(3) (src:288)
GIVEN `a health service given under s 11 of the State Health Insurance Law` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 14A(d)(3) "medical treatment outside Israel" the service is one` MEANS
    IF `a health service given under s 11 of the State Health Insurance Law` THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): the term means a service given under that section, and nothing else

-- s 14A(d)(1) and (2): subsections (a), (b) and (c1) do not apply to one who meets both: (1) was entitled for the calendar month before the month of exit;
-- (2) needs medical treatment outside Israel, or is entitled because their main time goes to caring for a son, daughter, spouse or parent (s 2(a)(7), 2(c))
-- and accompanies that sick family member who needs medical treatment outside Israel.  The benefit under this subsection is paid by the Minister's rules.
-- src:284 | {{ח:תת|(ד)|(1)}} הוראות סעיפים קטנים (א), (ב) ו־(ג1) לא יחולו על מי שמתקיימים בו שניים אלה:
-- src:285 | {{ח:תתתת|(1)}} הוא היה זכאי לגמלה בעד החודש הקלנדרי שקדם לחודש היציאה;
-- src:286 | {{ח:תתתת|(2)}} הוא נזקק לטיפול רפואי מחוץ לישראל, או שהוא זכאי לגמלה מאחר שעיקר זמנו מוקדש לטיפול בבנו, בבתו, בבן זוגו או בהורהו לפי הוראות {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 2|סעיפים 2(א)(7)}} {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 2|ו־2(ג)}} (להלן – בן משפחה חולה) והוא נלווה לבן משפחתו החולה אשר נזקק לטיפול רפואי מחוץ לישראל;
-- src:287 | {{ח:תתת|(2)}} גמלה לפי סעיף קטן זה תשולם לפי כללים, תנאים ולתקופה שיקבע השר;
@ref s 14A(d)(1)-(2) (src:284-287)
GIVEN `they were entitled for the calendar month before the month of exit` IS A BOOLEAN
      `they need medical treatment outside Israel` IS A BOOLEAN
      `they are entitled because their main time goes to caring for a son, daughter, spouse or parent, and they accompany that family member who needs medical treatment outside Israel` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the rules, conditions and period the Minister set are met` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 14A(d) subsections (a), (b) and (c1) do not apply to the person` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `they were entitled for the calendar month before the month of exit`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the exception needs both limbs
        IF (NOT (`they need medical treatment outside Israel` OR `they are entitled because their main time goes to caring for a son, daughter, spouse or parent, and they accompany that family member who needs medical treatment outside Israel`)) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the exception needs both limbs
        IF `the rules, conditions and period the Minister set are met` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): the benefit "תשולם לפי כללים, תנאים ולתקופה שיקבע השר", which are not among the sources

-- s 14A(e): if a person abroad who is not entitled because of this section has an entitled spouse in Israel, the benefit is paid to that spouse at the rate
-- for an individual of their family composition.  The rate is worked out by s 5(a) for the individual household and passed in.
-- src:289 | {{ח:תת|(ה)}} היה לאדם הנמצא מחוץ לישראל ואשר אינו זכאי לגמלה בשל הוראות סעיף זה בן זוג זכאי הנמצא בישראל, תשולם הגמלה לאותו בן זוג, בשיעור המשתלם ליחיד, לפי הרכב משפחתו.
@ref s 14A(e) (src:289)
GIVEN `the person abroad is not entitled to the benefit because of s 14A` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the spouse is entitled and is in Israel` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the benefit for an individual of the spouse's family composition` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 14A(e) the benefit paid to the spouse in Israel` MEANS
    IF `the person abroad is not entitled to the benefit because of s 14A` AND `the spouse is entitled and is in Israel`
    THEN `the benefit for an individual of the spouse's family composition`
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the subsection speaks of an entitled spouse in Israel of a person who is abroad and not entitled because of this section

-- s 14A(f)(2): paragraph (1) does not apply to (a) one who told the Institute, at the time, on the conditions and in the manner the Minister set, of leaving
-- Israel, the estimated period of absence and the return; (b) one who stayed outside Israel to receive medical treatment under s 11 of the State Health Insurance Law.
-- src:291 | {{ח:תתת|(2)}} הוראות פסקה (1) לא יחולו על אלה:
-- src:292 | {{ח:תתתת|(א)}} מי שהודיע למוסד לביטוח לאומי במועד, בתנאים ובאופן שקבע השר, על יציאתו מישראל, על תקופת היעדרותו המשוערת ממנה ועל חזרתו אליה;
-- src:293 | {{ח:תתתת|(ב)}} מי ששהה מחוץ לישראל לצורך קבלת טיפול רפואי הניתן לפי הוראות {{ח:חיצוני|חוק ביטוח בריאות ממלכתי#סעיף 11|סעיף 11 בחוק ביטוח בריאות ממלכתי, התשנ״ד–1994}}.
@ref s 14A(f)(2) (src:291-293)
GIVEN `they told the Institute of the exit, the estimated absence and the return, at the time, on the conditions and in the manner the Minister set` IS A BOOLEAN
      `they stayed outside Israel to receive medical treatment under s 11 of the State Health Insurance Law` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 14A(f)(2) paragraph (1) does not apply to the person` MEANS
    IF `they told the Institute of the exit, the estimated absence and the return, at the time, on the conditions and in the manner the Minister set`
       OR `they stayed outside Israel to receive medical treatment under s 11 of the State Health Insurance Law`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the subparagraphs name two classes

-- s 14A(f)(1): an entitled person who stayed outside Israel for at least 183 days within 12 consecutive months is treated as outside Israel until 12 consecutive
-- months have gone by in which they stayed in Israel for at least 183 days; and in the period in which they stayed in Israel as stated, their spouse is
-- treated for the Law as an individual.
-- src:290 | {{ח:תת|(ו)|(1)}} שהה זכאי לגמלה מחוץ לישראל 183 ימים לפחות במהלך 12 חודשים רצופים, יראו אותו כמי שנמצא מחוץ לישראל כל עוד לא תמו 12 חודשים רצופים שבהם שהה בישראל 183 ימים לפחות, ובתקופה שבה שהה בישראל כאמור יראו בבן זוגו, לענין ההוראות לפי חוק זה, כיחיד.
@ref s 14A(f)(1) (src:290)
GIVEN `the days the entitled person stayed outside Israel within 12 consecutive months` IS A NUMBER
      `12 consecutive months in which they stayed in Israel for at least 183 days have gone by since` IS A BOOLEAN
      `paragraph (1) does not apply to the person under subsection (f)(2)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 14A(f)(1) the entitled person is treated as outside Israel` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `paragraph (1) does not apply to the person under subsection (f)(2)` EQUALS JUST TRUE THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): (2) "הוראות פסקה (1) לא יחולו על אלה"
        IF `the days the entitled person stayed outside Israel within 12 consecutive months` AT LEAST 183 AND (NOT `12 consecutive months in which they stayed in Israel for at least 183 days have gone by since`) THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): fewer than 183 days outside, or the 12 months in Israel have gone by

-- src:290 | {{ח:תת|(ו)|(1)}} שהה זכאי לגמלה מחוץ לישראל 183 ימים לפחות במהלך 12 חודשים רצופים, יראו אותו כמי שנמצא מחוץ לישראל כל עוד לא תמו 12 חודשים רצופים שבהם שהה בישראל 183 ימים לפחות, ובתקופה שבה שהה בישראל כאמור יראו בבן זוגו, לענין ההוראות לפי חוק זה, כיחיד.
@ref s 14A(f)(1) the spouse (src:290)
GIVEN `the entitled person is treated as outside Israel under s 14A(f)(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the period is one in which the entitled person stayed in Israel as paragraph (1) describes` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 14A(f)(1) the spouse is treated as an individual` MEANS
    IF `the entitled person is treated as outside Israel under s 14A(f)(1)` AND `the period is one in which the entitled person stayed in Israel as paragraph (1) describes`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "ובתקופה שבה שהה בישראל כאמור" -- the spouse is an individual only in that period

§ `Section 14B -- the heating grant (מענק חימום)`

-- s 14B: one entitled to the benefit for one of October, November or December of a calendar year (the month of entitlement) is entitled to a heating grant of
-- 6.4% of the basic amount, if in the month of entitlement or earlier they reached retirement age.  One grant a year: the text names the grant, not a grant
-- for each month (fork `heating-grant-once-a-year`).  "The first month of the year by which they had reached retirement age" is 1 to 12, 0 if before the year, 13 if not in the year.
-- src:296 | {{ח:ת}} הזכאי לגמלה בעד אחד מהחודשים אוקטובר, נובמבר או דצמבר של שנה קלנדרית (להלן – חודש הזכאות), יהיה זכאי למענק חימום בשיעור של 6.4% מהסכום הבסיסי, אם בחודש הזכאות או במועד מוקדם יותר הוא הגיע לגיל פרישה.
@ref s 14B (src:296)
GIVEN figures IS A Figures
      `entitled for October` IS A BOOLEAN
      `entitled for November` IS A BOOLEAN
      `entitled for December` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the first month of the calendar year by which they had reached retirement age` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 14B the heating grant` MEANS
    IF (`entitled for October` AND `the first month of the calendar year by which they had reached retirement age` AT MOST 10)
       OR (`entitled for November` AND `the first month of the calendar year by which they had reached retirement age` AT MOST 11)
       OR (`entitled for December` AND `the first month of the calendar year by which they had reached retirement age` AT MOST 12)
    THEN JUST (6.4% TIMES figures's `the basic amount`)
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the grant is for one entitled for October, November or December who has reached retirement age by then

§ `Section 15 -- the grant on death (מענק עקב פטירה)`

DECLARE `Death grant recipient` IS ONE OF
    `the person's spouse at the time of death`
    `one of the person's children`

-- s 15(a): when an entitled person who was paid a benefit dies, the Institute pays the grant to the person who was their spouse at the time of death, and if
-- there is none, to one of their children.
-- The quotation stops at "מענק בסכום": what the consolidation prints after "הסכום הבסיסי" is dealt with at `s 15(a) the amount of the death grant` below and in NOTES.md (correction note of 2026-11-10).
-- src:299 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} נפטר זכאי שהיתה משתלמת לו גימלה, ישלם המוסד לביטוח לאומי למי שהיה בן זוגו בשעת פטירתו, ובאין בן זוג – לאחד מילדיו, מענק בסכום …
@ref s 15(a) who (src:299)
GIVEN `the deceased was an entitled person who was being paid a benefit` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the deceased had a spouse at the time of death` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the deceased has a child` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE `Death grant recipient`
`s 15(a) who is paid the death grant` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `the deceased was an entitled person who was being paid a benefit`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the grant is for the death of an entitled person who was paid a benefit
        IF `the deceased had a spouse at the time of death` THEN JUST `the person's spouse at the time of death`
        IF `the deceased has a child` THEN JUST `one of the person's children`
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the text names a spouse or a child and says nothing of anyone else

-- s 15(a): the grant equals the basic amount ("סכום השווה לסכום הבסיסי"), as SH 1892 p.474 s 67(4) amended it, in force 1 January 2006.
-- Correction of 2026-11-10 (NOTES.md): an earlier version of this function followed the consolidation, which after "הסכום הבסיסי" also prints "כפי שהיה ב־1 באפריל שלפני יום הפטירה; חל פיצוי לאחר מכן, יוגדל המענק בשיעור הפיצוי." (CONSOLIDATION-ONLY).
-- The 1 April words are the 1980 text (SH 991 p.34), the compensation sentence is the 1985 addition (SH 1145 p.112 s 17), and SH 1892 p.474 s 67(4) replaces the tail beginning "השווה לשכר הממוצע" by "השווה לסכום הבסיסי." (SH 1882 p.169 s 17(9) had changed "למחצית השכר הממוצע" to "לשכר הממוצע").
-- ASSUMED, not in the text: s 15(a) as amended names no day for the basic amount, so the input is the basic amount in force on the day of death (fork `death-grant-basic-amount-day`, F20).
-- AMBIG: whether the 1985 compensation sentence survives the replacement; taken as gone, so the grant carries no compensation increase (fork `death-grant-compensation-sentence`, F21).
-- src:299 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} נפטר זכאי שהיתה משתלמת לו גימלה, ישלם המוסד לביטוח לאומי למי שהיה בן זוגו בשעת פטירתו, ובאין בן זוג – לאחד מילדיו, מענק בסכום השווה לסכום הבסיסי …
@ref s 15(a) the amount (src:299)
GIVEN `the basic amount in force on the day of death` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 15(a) the amount of the death grant` MEANS
    `the basic amount in force on the day of death`

-- s 15(b): one entitled both to this grant and to the death grant of s 310 of the Insurance Law may choose one of them.
-- src:300 | {{ח:תת|(ב)}} הזכאי למענק פטירה לפי סעיף זה וכן למענק פטירה לפי {{ח:חיצוני|חוק הביטוח הלאומי#סעיף 310|סעיף 310 בחוק הביטוח}}, בידו הברירה לקבל אחד מהם.
@ref s 15(b) (src:300)
GIVEN `entitled to the death grant under s 15` IS A BOOLEAN
      `entitled to the death grant under s 310 of the Insurance Law` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 15(b) how many of the two grants the person may receive` MEANS
    IF `entitled to the death grant under s 15` AND `entitled to the death grant under s 310 of the Insurance Law`
    THEN JUST 1
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the subsection speaks of one entitled to both

§ `Section 17 -- the right to claim compensation (זכות לתביעה ולפיצוי)`

-- s 17(a): the Institute may claim from a person liable by law or agreement for the maintenance of one who was paid a benefit compensation for the benefit paid or to be paid.
-- src:306 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} אדם החייב על פי כל דין או הסכם במזונותיו של מי ששולמה לו או בעדו גימלה, רשאי המוסד לביטוח לאומי לתבוע ממנו פיצוי על הגימלה ששילם או שהוא עתיד לשלמה.
@ref s 17(a) (src:306)
GIVEN `the person is liable by law or by agreement for the maintenance of one who was paid a benefit` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 17(a) the Institute may claim compensation from the person` MEANS
    IF `the person is liable by law or by agreement for the maintenance of one who was paid a benefit`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the Institute's claim is against one liable for the maintenance

-- s 17(c): the District Court hears the Institute's claim; but if a religious court is hearing the maintenance rights of the one paid the benefit, that court may hear it too.
-- src:308 | {{ח:תת|(ג)}} בית המשפט המוסמך לדון בתביעת המוסד לביטוח לאומי לפיצוי לפי סעיף זה הוא בית המשפט המחוזי; ואולם אם בית דין דתי דן בזכויותיו למזונות של מי ששולמה לו או בעדו גימלה, יהא אותו בית דין מוסמך לדון גם בתביעת המוסד לביטוח לאומי לפי סעיף זה.
@ref s 17(c) (src:308)
GIVEN `the claim is the Institute's claim for compensation under s 17` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 17(c) the District Court may hear the claim` MEANS
    IF `the claim is the Institute's claim for compensation under s 17` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

-- src:308 | {{ח:תת|(ג)}} בית המשפט המוסמך לדון בתביעת המוסד לביטוח לאומי לפיצוי לפי סעיף זה הוא בית המשפט המחוזי; ואולם אם בית דין דתי דן בזכויותיו למזונות של מי ששולמה לו או בעדו גימלה, יהא אותו בית דין מוסמך לדון גם בתביעת המוסד לביטוח לאומי לפי סעיף זה.
@ref s 17(c) the religious court (src:308)
GIVEN `the claim is the Institute's claim for compensation under s 17` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a religious court is hearing the maintenance rights of the one who was paid the benefit` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 17(c) the religious court may also hear the claim` MEANS
    IF `the claim is the Institute's claim for compensation under s 17` AND `a religious court is hearing the maintenance rights of the one who was paid the benefit`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): only where a religious court is hearing the maintenance rights

§ `Section 18 -- the power to withhold a benefit (סמכות לשלול גימלה)`

-- s 18: the Institute may reduce, suspend or revoke the benefit of one who, without sufficient justification, broke instructions given in connection with
-- vocational training or rehabilitation, or acted in a way publicly known to be liable to prevent or delay recovery or the return of capacity to work.
-- src:311 | {{ח:ת}} המוסד לביטוח לאומי רשאי להפחית, להשהות או לשלול גימלה למי שהפר ללא צידוק מספיק הוראות שניתנו לו בקשר להכשרה מקצועית או לשיקום מקצועי, או למי שנהג בדרך שמן המפורסמות הוא כי היא עלולה למנוע את החלמתו או החזרת כושר עבודתו או לעכב בעדן.
@ref s 18 (src:311)
GIVEN `broke, without sufficient justification, instructions given in connection with vocational training or vocational rehabilitation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `acted in a way publicly known to be liable to prevent or delay recovery or the return of capacity to work` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 18 the Institute may reduce, suspend or revoke the benefit` MEANS
    IF `broke, without sufficient justification, instructions given in connection with vocational training or vocational rehabilitation`
       OR `acted in a way publicly known to be liable to prevent or delay recovery or the return of capacity to work`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the power is for the two cases; a breach with sufficient justification is not within it
